promptEn:
{
  "aspect_ratio": "4:5",
  "prompt": "SCENE: {argument name=\"location\" default=\"Cappadocia, Göreme viewpoint\"}, late January winter morning. Chilly air, soft mist in the distance, wet stone ground with subtle reflections. Fairy chimneys and valley silhouettes in the background with gentle haze. Overcast sky with a slight warm break in the clouds near sunrise. BACKGROUND BALLOONS: multiple hot air balloons floating in the mid-distance sky behind her (small-to-medium size, not too close), softly blurred by depth of field, some partially fading into mist for realism. Balloons must NOT overlap or block her head/face. OUTFIT: beige wool coat, chunky knit scarf, knit beanie, simple gloves. Natural minimal makeup. ACTION: holding a warm drink cup (salep/coffee) with both hands near chest, relaxed shoulders, gentle friendly smile, warm eye contact. CAMERA: eye-level, medium close-up (chest-up), 50–85mm portrait look, shallow depth of field, sharp focus on eyes, clean influencer photo realism, subtle film grain. DETAILS: a few subtle raindrops on coat/hair (very minimal), cozy welcoming travel vibe.",
  "negative_prompt": "balloons covering face, balloons overlapping head, balloons too close to camera, giant balloon in foreground, cluttered sky, too many balloons, summer clothing, harsh midday sunlight, neon cyberpunk, heavy storm, dense fog covering face, wet hair covering eyes, face blur, low-res, oversharpen, HDR, beauty filter, watermark, logo, text"
}

promptCh:
{
  "aspect_ratio": "4:5",
  "prompt": "场景：{argument name=\"location\" default=\"卡帕多奇亚，格雷梅观景点\"}，一月下旬的冬日清晨。空气微寒，远处薄雾弥漫，湿润的石地面隐约有反光。背景是仙女烟囱和山谷的剪影，笼罩着一层轻柔的薄雾。阴沉的天空，日出时分云层中透出一丝暖光。 背景气球：她身后中景处有多个热气球漂浮在空中（大小适中，不要太近），景深使其柔和模糊，有些气球部分融入薄雾中，以增加真实感。气球不得重叠或遮挡她的头部/面部。 服装：米色羊毛大衣，粗针织围巾，针织帽，简约手套。自然淡妆。 动作：双手捧着一杯热饮（土耳其兰花热饮/咖啡）靠近胸口，肩膀放松，温柔友好的微笑，眼神温暖。 相机：视线水平，中景特写（胸部以上），50–85mm 人像风格，浅景深，眼睛清晰对焦，干净的网红照片真实感，细微的胶片颗粒感。 细节：大衣/头发上有一些细微的雨滴（非常少），营造出舒适温馨的旅行氛围。",
  "negative_prompt": "气球遮脸，气球重叠头部，气球离相机太近，前景有巨大气球，天空杂乱，气球太多，夏季服装，刺眼的午间阳光，霓虹赛博朋克，暴风雨，浓雾遮脸，湿发遮眼，面部模糊，低分辨率，过度锐化，HDR，美颜滤镜，水印，标志，文字"
}

