promptEn:
{
  "prompt": "A photorealistic cinematic portrait, replicating the exact composition, pose, and surreal concept of image_1.png. The main female subject, a blonde Caucasian girl, sitting cross-legged on a wooden floor with a warm smile, now HAS THE PRECISE FACIAL FEATURES AND LIKENESS of the person in image_0.png. She is wearing a bold pink top and blue jeans. She is surrounded by seven miniature, realistic versions of herself (all sharing the face from image_0.png with slightly enlarged heads and playful expressions). Two miniatures stand on her upturned palms, two sit on her shoulders, one pushes at her right shoe, one runs in the foreground, and one hugs her left knee from behind, matching the poses in image_1.png perfectly. Soft, high-quality studio lighting creates realistic shadows. The background is a clean, gradient grey studio wall. 8k resolution, highly detailed textures.",
  "aspect_ratio": "4:5",
  "negative_prompt": "cartoon, 3d render, anime, chibi, painting, drawing, low quality, blurry, distorted face, bad anatomy, extra fingers, missing limbs, mismatched faces."
}

promptCh:
{
  "prompt": "一张电影般的超现实肖像照，与 image_1.png 的构图、姿势和超现实概念完全一致。主体是一位金发白人女孩，盘腿坐在木地板上，面带温暖的微笑，她的面部特征和肖像与 image_0.png 中的人物完全吻合。她穿着一件大胆的粉色上衣和蓝色牛仔裤。她被七个迷你版的自己（所有迷你版都拥有 image_0.png 中的面孔，头部略微放大，表情俏皮）所环绕。其中两个迷你版站在她向上翻的手掌上，两个坐在她的肩膀上，一个推着她的右鞋，一个在前景中奔跑，一个从后面抱着她的左膝，姿势与 image_1.png 完全匹配。柔和、高质量的影棚灯光营造出逼真的阴影。背景是干净的渐变灰色影棚墙。8k 分辨率，高度详细的纹理。",
  "aspect_ratio": "4:5",
  "negative_prompt": "卡通、3D 渲染、动漫、Q 版、绘画、素描、低质量、模糊、面部扭曲、解剖结构不良、多余的手指、肢体缺失、面部不匹配。"
}

promptEn:
{
