  },
  "prompt_payload": {
    "positive_prompt": "Ultra realistic cinematic fashion film scene, Vogue-style street editorial photography. Golden hour soft sunlight creates defined shadows, rim lighting on hair, and dimensional contrast across a modern urban architecture background featuring clean geometric lines and wide open space. The main subject is a beautiful woman with shoulder-length voluminous wavy hair having a healthy shine, and natural glowing makeup. She is walking forward with a confident facial expression, sharp jawline, and strong runway posture; shoulders relaxed but powerful, chin lifted elegantly. She wears a stylish trendy high-end fashion look: a modern tailored blazer layered over a fitted top and wide-leg trousers, with subtle statement accessories. Premium fabric textures with realistic folds are visible. A light wind gently moves her hair and outfit edges, creating cinematic motion. The shot is a low-to-mid angle tracking shot using a cinematic 35mm lens with shallow depth of field; the background is slightly blurred but recognizable. Balanced symmetrical composition, sharp focus on the subject, highly detailed realistic skin texture.",
    "negative_prompt": "glitch effect, surreal distortion, cyberpunk neon, fantasy elements, sci-fi props, exaggerated wind, overdramatic pose, anime style, cartoon, low resolution, blurry face, distorted body proportions

promptCh:
{
  "prompt_metadata": {
    "title": "都市黄金时段时尚大片",
    "style_type": "电影级时尚短片 / Vogue 风格街头摄影",
    "primary_focus": "逼真纹理、自信姿态、戏剧性光线"
  },
  "prompt_payload": {
    "positive_prompt": "超现实电影级时尚短片场景，Vogue 风格街头时尚摄影。黄金时段柔和的阳光营造出清晰的阴影，发丝上的轮廓光，以及现代都市建筑背景上的立体对比，背景具有简洁的几何线条和开阔的空间。主体是一位美丽的女性，她留着齐肩的蓬松波浪发，头发健康有光泽，妆容自然透亮。她面带自信的表情向前走，下颌线清晰，T 台姿态有力；双肩放松但充满力量，下巴优雅地抬起。她身着时尚潮流的高端时装：现代剪裁的西装外套内搭修身款上衣和阔腿裤，配有精致的个性配饰。优质面料的纹理和逼真的褶皱清晰可见。微风轻拂她的头发和服装边缘，营造出电影般的动感。这是一个低角度至中角度的跟踪镜头，使用电影级 35mm 镜头，景深较浅；背景略微模糊但可辨识。构图平衡对称，主体对焦锐利，皮肤纹理细节高度逼真。",
    "negative_prompt": "故障效果、超现实扭曲、赛博朋克霓虹、奇幻元素、科幻道具、夸张的风、过度戏剧化的姿势、动漫风格、卡通、低分辨率、模糊的面部、扭曲的身体比例"
  }
}

