  "prompt": "A playful blonde woman posing in front of a fairytale castle at a theme park during golden hour. She is standing on a cobblestone walkway with the castle’s pink and blue turrets in the background. She is wearing red athletic shorts and a white mesh tank top with a small kitten graphic and the letters &#x27;ATM&#x27; on it, slightly lifting the hem of the shirt. She has a red shoulder bag, soft natural makeup, and is smiling with her tongue out in a fun, carefree expression. Warm sunset lighting, vibrant colors, shallow depth of field, high-resolution, candid travel photography style.",
