promptEn:
{
  "prompt": "Ultra-realistic high-end smartphone-style portrait, 4:5 vertical, 8K resolution. Two stylish young women in their mid-20s seated on a white leather sectional sofa in a bright modern lounge. Left woman: long sleek dark high ponytail, polished glam makeup with defined brows and natural-toned lips, calm focused expression while looking at an orange smartphone. Wearing a structured red fitted top with clean seam detailing and tailored shorts or skirt. Black sheer tights and pointed heels. Relaxed seated posture. Right woman: light red hair styled in a neat low bun, refined makeup with soft glossy lips, friendly confident smile toward the camera. Wearing a red halter-style fitted dress with elegant tailoring. Black sheer tights and pointed heels. Seated beside her in a natural relaxed pose. A yellow handbag placed next to them on the sofa. Environment: bright upscale apartment lounge with white walls, warm wood accents, indoor potted plant, light wood coffee table, soft carpet, large windows with sheer curtains and greenery visible outside, subtle decorative neon wall sign. Lighting: soft diffused natural daylight, warm ambient tones, gentle highlights, no harsh shadows. Camera: eye-level medium full-body framing, natural smartphone photo perspective, moderate depth of field. Overall mood: modern luxury lifestyle photography, daytime fashion aesthetic, clean influencer-style composition, photorealistic skin tones and detailed fabric textures."
}

promptCh:
{
  "prompt": "超逼真的高端智能手机风格肖像，4:5 竖版，8K 分辨率。两位 20 多岁时尚年轻女性，坐在一间明亮现代休息室的白色皮革组合沙发上。 左侧女性：乌黑亮丽的高马尾，精致迷人的妆容，眉毛清晰，唇色自然，表情平静专注，正在看一部橙色智能手机。身穿结构感强的红色修身款上衣，缝线细节利落，搭配剪裁考究的短裤或短裙。黑色透明丝袜和尖头高跟鞋。坐姿放松。 右侧女性：浅红色头发，梳着整洁的低发髻，精致妆容，柔和的亮泽双唇，对着镜头露出友善自信的笑容。身穿红色挂脖式修身连衣裙，剪裁优雅。黑色透明丝袜和尖头高跟鞋。自然放松地坐在她旁边。 一个黄色手提包放在她们旁边的沙发上。 环境：明亮高档的公寓休息室，白色墙壁，暖色木质装饰，室内盆栽植物，浅色木质咖啡桌，柔软地毯，带有透明窗帘的大窗户，窗外可见绿植，微妙的装饰性霓虹灯墙面标志。 灯光：柔和漫射的自然日光，温暖的环境色调，柔和的高光，无强烈阴影。 相机：平视中景全身构图，自然智能手机照片视角，适度景深。 整体氛围：现代奢华生活方式摄影，白天时尚美学，简洁的网红风格构图，照片级真实的肤色和细致的织物质感。"
}

promptEn:
{
  "generation_request": {
    "meta_data": {
      "task_type": "studio_fashion_editorial_motion_echo_portrait",
      "language": "en",
      "priority": "highest",
      "version": "v1.0_RED_STUDIO_TUX_MOTION_ECHO"
    },
    "input": {
      "mode": "text_to_image",
      "notes": "Create a high-fashion studio portrait of a stylish adult man in a classic black tuxedo with a bow tie and white pleated shirt. Solid deep-red seamless backdrop and red floor, monochrome red environment. Subject is leaning/sitting in a relaxed pose with one hand slightly raised near the face (fingers softly bent), the other hand resting lower near the waist. Add a strong multi-exposure / motion-echo effect: 2–3 translucent offset duplicates trailing to the right, like a long-exposure movement smear. Keep the main face sharp and dominant, with the echoes softer and semi-transparent. Lux editorial retouching, crisp fabric texture, subtle skin texture, cinematic contrast. Clean image: no text, no logos, no watermark."
    },
    "output": {
      "aspect_ratio": "4:5",
      "resolution": "ultra_high",
      "num_images": 1,
      "sharpness": "editorial_crisp",
      "grain": "subtle_analog"
    },
    "scene": {
      "environment": "studio cyclorama seamless backdrop, fully red, minimal set",
      "lighting": {
        "style": "hard studio key + subtle fill",
        "key_light": "beauty dish or small softbox slightly above eye level, forward-left",
        "fill": "very light fill to keep shadows readable",
        "rim": "faint rim to separate tux from red background",
        "look": "high contrast, glossy editorial finish"
      },
      "camera": {
        "shot_type": "3/4 portrait",
        "angle": "slightly above eye level",
        "lens_look": "85mm portrait compression",
        "depth_of_field": "medium shallow, face tack sharp"
      },
      "color_grade": {
        "palette": "dominant deep reds, true blacks, clean whites",
        "contrast": "high",
        "highlights": "controlled",
        "skin_tone": "natural but slightly warm under red bounce"
      }
    },
    "subject": {
      "person": "adult man",
      "appearance": {
        "hair": "short, styled, slightly tousled",
        "facial_hair": "short beard/stubble, well-groomed",
        "expression": "serious, confident gaze to camera"
      },
      "wardrobe": {
        "tuxedo": "black tuxedo jacket, sharp lapels",
        "shirt": "white pleated dress shirt",
        "bow_tie": "black bow tie",
        "pocket_square": "white pocket square",
        "accessories": "watch on wrist, subtle ring if desired"
      },
      "pose": {
        "body": "leaning/sitting with torso angled slightly",
        "hands": "one hand lifted near face, other hand lower near waist",
        "motion": "capture implied movement for multi-exposure echo"
      }
    },
    "effects": {
      "motion_echo": {
        "enabled": true,
        "echo_count": 3,
      }

