        "accessories": "A few simple beaded bracelets on her right wrist; a small earring in her left ear."
      },
      "environment": {
        "setting": "An old, narrow Indian village or town street (gully).",
        "architecture": "Sandstone-colored buildings with ornate wooden balconies and windows (jharokhas), heavily covered in handprints of colorful powder.",
        "crowd": "Numerous other people, all color-smeared, dancing, laughing, and throwing powder in the background. Their faces are joyful and distinct.",
        "props": "Stacks of large pots filled with colorful powders; colorful powder clouds are actively wafting through the air, creating a soft, colorful haze."
      }
    },
    "technical_metadata": {
      "lighting": "Natural, warm golden hour sunlight, diffusing through the powder-filled air",
      "resolution": "8K Ultra-HD, high-contrast, deep texture rendering",
      "camera_specs": "Shallow depth of field, focused on the central figure; natural grain texture",
