promptEn:
[
  {
    "id": "aerial-artist-red-dress",
    "prompt": "A detailed, professional studio photograph, centered against a dark matte black void background, captures an aerial silk artist in a dynamic, suspended pose. The subject is a female artist with flowing, platinum-silver hair, looking slightly upwards and to the left with a focused, serene expression. She is suspended in mid-air by a single, vertical white aerial silk which she holds firmly with her right hand above her head. Her body is in an open, near-split pose. She is wearing a deep burgundy-red silk or satin flowing dress with a high side slit, which is dramatically billowed outwards by an unseen force, creating a large, dynamic field of color around her lower body. The dress is layered over and accented by intricate white aerial silk fabric wraps that encircle her waist, torso, and are wrapped around her left ankle and foot. She has a thick black choker necklace. Her left arm is extended gracefully upwards and outwards. Her bare feet are pointed, one extended and one with the silk wrap. The dramatic, directional studio lighting (chiaroscuro) creates strong highlights on her skin and the folds of the fabrics, emphasizing the texture of the silk and the definition of her muscles, casting soft shadows. The overall composition is elegant, dramatic, and poetic, focusing on the beauty and control of the pose.",
    "weight": 1.0,
    "group_id": "image_content"
  },
  {
    "id": "composition_details",
    "prompt": "The composition is a medium full shot, framed to show the entire pose and the dramatic flow of the dress within the dark space. The central white silk hangs straight down, creating a strong vertical line that contrasts with the curved, flowing red fabric. The lighting is focused, like a theatrical spotlight, creating a dramatic halo effect around the edges of her hair and limbs against the deep black background. Every fold and ripple in the burgundy dress is visible, conveying motion and texture. The focus is sharp on her face and core body.",
    "weight": 0.8,
    "group_id": "style_and_lighting"
  },
  {
    "id": "fabric_motion",
    "prompt": "A close attention to detail is paid to the motion and texture of the fabrics. The red silk dress is shown in high-speed capture, suspended in mid-billow, forming a large, fan-like arc that mirrors the curve of her body. The folds are complex and deep, creating a play of light and shadow. The white wraps are taut against her body, contrasting with the free-flowing red dress, showing the dual nature of aerial silks.",
    "weight": 0.7,
    "group_id": "details"
  },
  {
    "id": "pose_detail",
    "prompt": "Specific description of the pose: The artist&#x27;s right hand grips the vertical white silk, her arm taut. Her left arm is free, fingers spread delicately. Her torso is twisted slightly. Her right leg is bent and wrapped, with the white silk coiling down to her foot. Her left leg is st

promptCh:
[
  {
    "id": "aerial-artist-red-dress",
    "prompt": "一张专业细致的摄影棚照片，以深色哑光黑色虚空背景为中心，捕捉了一位空中绸缎艺术家在动态悬浮姿态中的身影。主体是一位女性艺术家，她留着飘逸的铂金色头发，目光略微向上并向左看，表情专注而宁静。她被一根垂直的白色空中绸缎悬吊在半空中，右手高举过头，紧紧抓住绸缎。她的身体呈开放的近乎劈叉的姿势。她穿着一件深勃艮第红色丝绸或缎面飘逸连衣裙，裙摆高开叉，被一股无形的力量戏剧性地向外吹拂，在她下半身周围形成一片巨大而动感的色彩区域。连衣裙外面叠穿着精美的白色空中绸缎缠绕物，这些缠绕物环绕着她的腰部、躯干，并缠绕在她的左脚踝和脚上。她戴着一条粗黑色项圈。她的左臂优雅地向上向外伸展。她的双脚脚尖绷直，一只伸展，另一只缠绕着绸缎。戏剧性的定向摄影棚灯光（明暗对比法）在她皮肤和织物褶皱上形成强烈的高光，强调了丝绸的质感和肌肉的线条，投射出柔和的阴影。整体构图优雅、富有戏剧性且充满诗意，着重展现姿态的美感和控制力。",
    "weight": 1,
    "group_id": "image_content"
  },
  {
    "id": "composition_details",
    "prompt": "构图为中景全身照，旨在展示整个姿态以及连衣裙在黑暗空间中戏剧性的流动感。中央的白色绸缎笔直垂下，形成一条强烈的垂直线，与弯曲流动的红色织物形成对比。灯光集中，如同戏剧舞台上的聚光灯，在她的头发和四肢边缘形成戏剧性的光晕效果，衬托着深黑色的背景。勃艮第色连衣裙的每一个褶皱和波纹都清晰可见，传达出动感和质感。焦点清晰地落在她的脸部和身体核心。",
    "weight": 0.8,
    "group_id": "style_and_lighting"
  },
  {
