promptEn:
{
  "prompt": "A cinematic hyper-realistic 3D illustration of a handsome young boy with brown, messy hair and blue eyes, wearing a green hooded sweater and blue jeans, actively emerging from the pages of an open sketchbook. The sketchbook is placed on a worn, grain-rich wooden desk in a sun-drenched artist&#x27;s studio. The pages show a detailed, intricate graphite pencil drawing of the same boy, but he is breaking through the paper, which is realistically torn and jagged where he exits. One of his 3D hands grips the torn paper edge tightly, while his other 3D arm rests naturally outside the pages on the desk surface, palms down. He looks out with an expression of surprise and wonder. A realistic human hand with detailed skin texture is visible in the foreground near the drawing, holding a traditional yellow wooden pencil, with the tip of the pencil close to the sketch, as if just having completed a part of the boy&#x27;s form from which he is springing to life. Scattered pencil shavings, a large white eraser, and other art supplies like paintbrushes and jars are on the desk. Light from a large window in the background creates depth and a warm atmosphere. The rendering is high-resolution, with detailed textures for paper, graphite, wood grain, and skin."
}

promptCh:
{
  "prompt": "一张电影级的超现实 3D 插画，描绘了一个英俊的小男孩，他有着棕色凌乱的头发和蓝色的眼睛，身穿绿色连帽衫和蓝色牛仔裤，正生动地从一本打开的速写本页面中跃出。速写本放置在一张磨损、纹理丰富的木制书桌上，书桌位于阳光普照的艺术家工作室中。速写本的页面上展示着男孩的精细石墨铅笔画，但他正突破纸张，纸张在他跃出的地方真实地撕裂并参差不齐。他的一只 3D 手紧紧抓住撕裂的纸边缘，而另一只 3D 手臂则自然地放在页面外的书桌表面上，手掌朝下。他带着惊讶和好奇的表情向外看。前景中，靠近画作的地方，可见一只皮肤纹理细致的真实人手，正握着一支传统的黄色木铅笔，铅笔尖靠近素描，仿佛刚刚完成男孩身体的一部分，而他正从那里跃然而生。桌上散落着铅笔屑、一块大白色橡皮擦以及画笔和罐子等其他美术用品。背景中大窗户透出的光线营造出深度和温暖的氛围。渲染效果为高分辨率，纸张、石墨、木纹和皮肤的纹理都非常细致。"
}

