  "Ultra-realistic cinematic portrait of a woman (same face, hairstyle, and overall appearance as reference image), walking through a rainy city street at night. Neon sign lights reflect across wet asphalt and puddles, creating shimmering colors. Raindrops bead on her jacket and subtle droplets cling to loose hair strands. She has a calm but moody expression, eyes slightly thoughtful as she looks ahead. Background is softly blurred with beautiful bokeh lights from traffic and storefronts. Film-like atmosphere with blue and red neon contrast, soft rim lighting on her shoulders, and light mist in the air. Dynamic street reflections, shallow depth of field, detailed skin texture, realistic wet fabric, natural posture, cinematic composition, 85mm lens look, volumetric light, high resolution, photoreal, studio-grade quality.": "一位女性的超现实电影感肖像（与参考图像中的面部、发型和整体外观一致），在雨夜的城市街道上行走。霓虹灯光映照在湿润的柏油路和水坑上，形成闪烁的色彩。雨滴凝结在她的夹克上，细小的水珠附着在散落的发丝上。她表情平静而略带忧郁，眼神略显沉思地望向前方。背景柔和模糊，交通和店面的散景灯光美丽动人。电影般的氛围，蓝色和红色霓虹灯形成对比，她的肩膀上有柔和的轮廓光，空气中弥漫着淡淡的薄雾。动态的街景反射，浅景深，细致的皮肤纹理，逼真的湿润织物，自然的姿态，电影构图，85mm 镜头效果，体积光，高分辨率，照片级真实感，影棚级品质。",
