      "orientation": "portrait",
      "resolution": "ultra_high_res",
      "render_style": "ultra_photoreal_lifestyle_editorial",
      "sharpness": "crisp_but_natural",
      "film_grain": "none_or_minimal",
      "color_grade": "warm_gallery_luxe_true_to_life"
    },
    "creative_prompt": {
      "scene_summary": "Recreate the reference photo EXACTLY in a classic museum gallery. Scene & environment (match reference): - Deep red patterned wallpapered gallery wall. - Large gold-framed landscape painting centered high on the wall. - Two smaller gold-framed paintings on the right side of the large painting. - Warm wooden floor, museum bench in the background, and a small nude classical statue on a pedestal far right. - A large white marble statue group in the foreground-right: a classical female figure leaning forward, one hand cupped to her ear as if listening. The statue stands on a white base. Subject (single person, match reference): - One woman standing in the foreground-left, side profile facing the statue. - Pose: she cups her hands around her mouth, leaning in as if whispering into the statue’s ear. - Outfit: sleeveless black top; light beige pants/jeans. - Accessories: sunglasses resting on top of head; wristwatch and bracelets; crossbody brown leather bag strap across torso with bag visible at hip. - Hair: blonde, shoulder-length, straight/softly layered. Lighting & camera (match reference): - Warm indoor museum lighting with soft highlights and realistic shadows. - Natural smartphone/lifestyle photo realism (not studio), accurate perspective and scale. - Keep the same framing: woman on left, large statue on right, paintings aligned behind. Realism requirements: - Natural skin texture, no plastic smoothing. - Marble statue texture: matte stone with subtle specular highlights; crisp sculptural detail. - Correct anatomy: hands cupped naturally; no extra fingers. Text rules: - No readable text, no signage, no watermark, no logo"
    }
  }
}

