promptEn:
{
  "prompt": "Photorealistic group portrait of the four members of Blackpink—Jisoo, Jennie, Rosé, and Lisa—posed together on a wide modern indoor staircase. They are dressed in a coordinated high-fashion theme of plunging tailored blazers styled as bodysuits with latex t-fronts and glossy stilettos. The composition is a staggered, symmetrical arrangement across the wooden steps. --ar 3:4",
  "subject": {
    "jisoo": "On the top step, Kim Jisoo has long dark chocolate hair, heart-shaped lips, and an elegant, serene expression. She wears a royal blue blazer bodysuit.",
    "jennie": "Seated a step below, Jennie Kim has long wavy espresso hair and fierce feline eyes, leaning slightly forward. She wears a crimson red blazer bodysuit.",
    "rose": "Next to Jennie, Park Chaeyoung (Rosé) has extra-long platinum blonde hair and a slim, ethereal profile. She wears a soft pastel pink blazer bodysuit.",
    "lisa": "On the lower step, Lalisa Manobal has jet black hair with iconic thick straight-across bangs and large expressive eyes. She wears a charcoal gray blazer bodysuit.",
    "jewelry": "Each member wears matching silver hoop earrings and thin silver chains with small round pendants."
  },
  "outfit": {
    "clothing": "Four distinct plunging tailored blazers in royal blue, crimson, soft pink, and charcoal, each worn over matching latex t-front bodysuits.",
    "shoes": "Coordinated glossy patent leather stiletto pumps in black, red, nude, and silver."
  },
  "pose": {
    "body": "The group is arranged in a staggered formation on the stair treads, creating a powerful and symmetrical fashion editorial composition.",
    "legs": "Various poses with legs parted or angled to showcase the high-fashion footwear and staircase architecture.",
    "hands": "Hands are placed elegantly, some resting on knees, others touching the stairs or near their faces."
  },
  "background": {
    "environment": "A minimalist, modern indoor staircase with expansive space.",
    "structure": "Wide light oak wooden treads with clean white painted risers and pristine white walls."
  },
  "color_grading": "Soft, diffused studio-quality lighting. A high-fashion color palette that balances the vibrant blazer colors with the neutral wood and white background.",
  "exact_colors": {
    "jisoo_blue": "#002366",
    "jennie_red": "#990000",
    "rose_pink": "#F4C2C2",
    "lisa_gray": "#36454F",
    "hair_blonde": "#EAE5D9",
    "hair_dark": "#1A1110",
    "stair_wood": "#9B7653"
  }
}

promptCh:
{
  "prompt": "Blackpink 四位成员——Jisoo、Jennie、Rosé 和 Lisa——在宽阔的现代室内楼梯上摆姿势的写实群体肖像。她们穿着协调的高级时装主题，包括深 V 领定制西装外套作为连体衣穿着，内搭乳胶 T 字裆，脚踩光亮细高跟鞋。构图是在木质台阶上呈错落有致且对称的排列。--ar 3:4",
  "subject": {
    "jisoo": "在最顶端的台阶上，金智秀（Kim Jisoo）拥有深巧克力色的长发、心形嘴唇，表情优雅宁静。她身穿宝蓝色西装外套连体衣。",
    "jennie": "坐在下一级台阶上，Jennie Kim 拥有长长的波浪浓咖啡色头发和犀利的猫眼，身体微微前倾。她身穿深红色西装外套连体衣。",
    "rose": "在 Jennie 旁边，朴彩英（Rosé）拥有超长的铂金发色和纤细、空灵的侧脸。她身穿柔和的淡粉色西装外套连体衣。",
    "lisa": "在较低的台阶上，Lalisa Manobal 拥有乌黑的头发，标志性的厚齐刘海和大而富有表现力的眼睛。她身穿炭灰色西装外套连体衣。",
    "jewelry": "每位成员都佩戴相配的银色圆环耳环和带有小圆形吊坠的细银链。"
  },
  "outfit": {
    "clothing": "四件独特的深 V 领定制西装外套，颜色分别为宝蓝色、深红色、柔粉色和炭灰色，每件内搭相配的乳胶 T 字裆连体衣。",
    "shoes": "相配的亮面漆皮细高跟鞋，颜色分别为黑色、红色、裸色和银色。"
  },
  "pose": {
    "body": "团体在楼梯踏步上以错落有致的队形排列，营造出一种有力且对称的时尚杂志构图。",
    "legs": "各种姿势，双腿分开或成角度，以展示高级时尚鞋履和楼梯建筑。",
    "hands": "双手摆放优雅，有的放在膝盖上，有的触碰楼梯或靠近脸部。"
  },
  "background": {
    "environment": "一个极简主义的现代室内楼梯，空间宽敞。",
    "structure": "宽阔的浅橡木木质踏步，搭配洁净的白色油漆立板和原始的白色墙壁。"
  },
  "color_grading": "柔和、漫射的影棚级质量照明。高级时尚调色板，平衡了鲜艳的西装外套颜色与中性的木材和白色背景。",
  "exact_colors": {
    "jisoo_blue": "#002366",
    "jennie_red": "#990000",
    "rose_pink": "#F4C2C2",
    "lisa_gray": "#36454F",
    "hair_blonde": "#EAE5D9",
    "hair_dark": "#1A1110",
    "stair_wood": "#9B7653"
  }
}

