    "appearance": "beautiful young woman, fair flawless skin, striking bright blue eyes, subtle natural makeup with soft eyeliner and glossy lips, long voluminous wavy light-medium blonde platinum hair cascading over shoulders and chest, large realistic pointed elf ears (prosthetic, flesh-toned with shading)",
    "expression": "confident engaging gaze directly at camera, slight open-mouth smile or mid-speech playful expression, charismatic and alluring",
    "clothing": "elegant light green-and-gold fantasy elf gown inspired by high-fantasy RPG, ultra-deep plunging V-neckline with dramatic cleavage emphasis, ornate gold metallic corset bodice with intricate filigree patterns and emerald-green gemstone accents (large central diamond-shaped gem, smaller dangling gems), gold choker/collar with emerald centerpiece and delicate chains, gold arm cuffs on upper arms, sheer flowing off-shoulder white detached sleeves, gold-trimmed high-waisted corset belt with midriff cutouts, long white ruffled skirt with gold trim and subtle side slits",
    "accessories": "emerald gemstone jewelry suite (choker, corset gem, dangling accents), gold metallic detailing throughout",
    "pose": "three-quarter body turn toward camera, standing or leaning slightly forward in bedroom, one hand possibly near hair or face, confident posture highlighting bust and corset details",
    "body_details": "curvaceous figure with pronounced bust, realistic skin texture and subtle natural glow, fabric sheen on satin/gold elements, realistic prosthetic elf ears seamlessly blended"
  },
  "environment": {
    "location": "cozy anime/gaming fan bedroom",
    "background": "wall-to-wall bookshelves filled with colorful manga volumes, light novels, anime figurine boxes (One Piece Luffy figures, various shonen heroes, chibi statues), large detailed anime statues on shelves, plushies, collectible boxes in vibrant colors, soft pink-purple ambient LED lighting creating warm glow and color bleed on walls",
    "props": "dense otaku collection visible behind her — figurines, manga spines, game merchandise, no empty space"
  },
  "lighting": {
    "main_light": "soft ring light or LED panels from front creating flattering highlights on face, cleavage, gold elements, and hair",
    "secondary": "pink-purple ambient room glow, subtle rim lighting on hair and shoulders, realistic reflections on gold armor and gems",
    "mood": "intimate, enthusiastic cosplay showcase, warm otaku bedroom atmosphere with sensual fantasy elegance"
  },
  "camera": {
    "angle": "eye-level to slight low-angle medium shot, emphasizing bust, corset, and elf ears while showing background collection",
    "lens": "50mm prime lens, shallow depth of field, razor-sharp focus on face, ears, jewelry and upper body, soft bokeh on background shelves and figures",
    "composition": "subject centered, shelves framing left and right, balanced negative space above head, dynamic yet cozy framing"
  },
  "style": "hyper-realistic cosplay photography, high-end bedroom content-creator aesthetic, ultra-detailed textures (fabric weave, metallic gold shine, gem reflections, hair strands, prosthetic ear edges, book spines, figurine details), vibrant yet natural color grading with pink-purple warmth, photorealistic, no cartoon/anime filters",
  "technical": "8K resolution, RAW photo style, cinematic color grading, best quality, ultra-detailed, sharp focus, masterpiece",
  "negative_prompt": "blurry, deformed, extra limbs, bad anatomy, low quality, cartoon, anime style, painting, overexposed, underexposed, flat lighting, cheap costume, visible seams on ears, empty shelves, modern casual clothes"
}

