    "camera_angle": "Low angle, looking up from below, creating a sense of height and energy.",
    "lighting": "Bright, hard direct sunlight, creating sharp contrast and vivid colors, simulating a clear sunny day at noon.",
    "color_palette": "Vibrant primary color scheme: Deep Cobalt Blue (sky), Bright Yellow (shirt, socks), Bright Red (bag stripes, text), and Clean White (shoes, bag, scarf). Fujifilm Velvia/Vivid inspired color grading, high saturation, punchy contrast, rich greens and deep blues, vivid reds, crisp micro-contrast, vibrant but detailed.",
