  },
  "generation_prompt": "portrait of a girl [User Portrait Slot] with loose slightly messy natural hair, no hair accessories, winking at camera, wearing white satin pajamas [Apparel/Outfit Slot] and white socks, lying on a soft sofa in a cute bedroom, surrounded by teddy bears and plush toys, leg kicked up high towards camera, foreshortening, dynamic perspective, soft flash photography, cozy atmosphere, warm ambient light, fujifilm classic negative, realistic texture, 28mm lens, --ar 3:4 --v 6.0 --no hair accessories"
}

